      <activity id="4f5fa3f3-e6d4-5e58-97fb-0997aa78b5b3" activityNameId="8e8ad779-f21b-5139-8ed3-58610494b688" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tower silo, plastic</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tower silo, plastic
The module includes a foundation made of concrete and a tower silo made of glass fibre reinforced polyester. Size: 105 m3. Lifetime of the building is 25 years.;
UUID: f58ea05a-e822-38bf-ad61-d15fae7c4c7b
The inventory takes into account the use of construction materials and building machines for construction, repair and replacement including waste disposal and the transportation of the materials to the building site. Not taken into account were direct emission of the construction, disposal of production waste and the use of resources during utilization phase. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The data of the inventory are based on one example of a typical agricultural building.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The inventory is calculated based on a solid database of agricultural buildings. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f58ea05a-e822-38bf-ad61-d15fae7c4c7b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
